      "content": "- `vibe` and `vibe-acp` entry points during alpha - `vibe/cli/textual_ui/` runtime internals while tests still depend on them - Legacy config and environment fallbacks required by alpha compatibility - Compatibility adapters that bridge `vibe.*` to `rig_relay.*`",
